{"5065160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wreckfall", "steam_appid": 5065160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on an expedition through diverse biomes, challenging terrain, and obstacles. Progress through each environment, choose your own route, and find a way through whatever stands in your way. Keep moving forward toward the mountain on the horizon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY COLLISION HAS CONSEQUENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vehicle bends, crumples, and deforms in real time. Damage affects both its appearance and handling, forcing you to adapt when things go wrong. Push your vehicle too far, take a hard hit, or get stuck — find a way out and keep moving.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR WAY TO THE TOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through 4 biomes on your way to the summit. Each one brings new terrain, obstacles, and challenges to overcome. Push your vehicle to its limits as you make your way toward the snowy mountain, where the final climb awaits. The further you go, the harder it becomes to keep your vehicle moving.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE ON THE JOURNEY ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to overcome difficult terrain, race to reach the next section first, or get in each other’s way by pushing, blocking, and crashing into one another. Help each other through difficult sections — or make things harder for everyone. Just don’t damage your friend’s car. There’s no insurance.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW VEHICLES AND NEW WAYS TO TACKLE THE JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new vehicles as you progress, each with its own driving style and strengths. Choose the vehicle that suits the terrain, find your own route, and discover new ways to overcome the challenges ahead.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MOUNTAIN WON’T FORGIVE MISTAKES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After making your way through the four biomes, one final challenge awaits: the snowy mountain. Its steep and unforgiving terrain will push both you and your vehicle to the limit.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the top — or become another wreck left behind?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on an expedition through diverse biomes, challenging terrain, and obstacles. Progress through each environment, choose your own route, and find a way through whatever stands in your way. Keep moving forward toward the mountain on the horizon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY COLLISION HAS CONSEQUENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vehicle bends, crumples, and deforms in real time. Damage affects both its appearance and handling, forcing you to adapt when things go wrong. Push your vehicle too far, take a hard hit, or get stuck — find a way out and keep moving.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f35eaff89c062dc4b415da9d0900367b.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR WAY TO THE TOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through 4 biomes on your way to the summit. Each one brings new terrain, obstacles, and challenges to overcome. Push your vehicle to its limits as you make your way toward the snowy mountain, where the final climb awaits. The further you go, the harder it becomes to keep your vehicle moving.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f754dd0a4e48cd988e8623f53e9f28c3.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE ON THE JOURNEY ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to overcome difficult terrain, race to reach the next section first, or get in each other’s way by pushing, blocking, and crashing into one another. Help each other through difficult sections — or make things harder for everyone. Just don’t damage your friend’s car. There’s no insurance.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/f12cb5c701979b384420cfeccb3442ba.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW VEHICLES AND NEW WAYS TO TACKLE THE JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new vehicles as you progress, each with its own driving style and strengths. Choose the vehicle that suits the terrain, find your own route, and discover new ways to overcome the challenges ahead.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.poster.avif?t=1788348031\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.webm?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/extras/9651e837781431324efdad5d37a457e2.mp4?t=1788348031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MOUNTAIN WON’T FORGIVE MISTAKES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After making your way through the four biomes, one final challenge awaits: the snowy mountain. Its steep and unforgiving terrain will push both you and your vehicle to the limit.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the top — or become another wreck left behind?</p>", "short_description": "A physics-based driving simulator where you must overcome challenging terrain in a fully deformable vehicle and climb to the summit. Drive across diverse landscapes, choose your own route, and put your vehicle to the test. Play solo or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/a7a2de1b4a8e829690ee76c3fa14765347d9341c/header.jpg?t=1788348031", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/e5bd6eb1b4503b1488b79a156fc19db274172c44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788348031", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5065160/e5bd6eb1b4503b1488b79a156fc19db274172c44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788348031", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_requir